abstract: AI-collated edition of the 1837 text, Bodleian Sinica 690. All 140 IIIF
  canvases have initial transcription, independent source-first reading, comparison
  and source adjudication. Human/expert review not-run. Unresolved readings and unknown
  extents remain explicit. Modern punctuation is unreviewed and limited to the listed
  c005–c021 units. Fixed editorial snapshot 2026-10-21T04:26:15.997888+00:00. The
  version DOI was reserved at package preparation; registration takes effect on Zenodo
  publication, and the record provides the actual publication and registration status.
  Historical compiler 同仁堂司事 is distinct from the modern editor. Images excluded.
